01:30.777 --> 01:35.787
My First Friend

01:37.577 --> 01:41.737
He would never give up
on his dreams, or on reality.

01:42.327 --> 01:43.737
That's the kind of guy he is.

01:48.947 --> 01:53.947
And the way he forges ahead
draws others towards him.

01:54.447 --> 01:56.287
He makes you want to reach out
when he's about to stumble.

01:57.327 --> 01:59.577
And the greater
the support behind you,

02:00.197 --> 02:01.657
the closer you can get
to your goal.

02:08.867 --> 02:10.447
<i>Naruto's path...</i>

02:12.537 --> 02:13.037
Take this!

02:13.407 --> 02:15.987
Massive Rasen Shuriken!

02:19.697 --> 02:21.617
If comrades that you trust,
gather around you...

02:22.197 --> 02:25.117
Hope can take physical form
and become visible.

02:26.197 --> 02:27.537
That's what I believe, Obito.

02:29.447 --> 02:30.157
Perhaps...

02:33.367 --> 02:36.367
That Wood Dragon will absorb
your chakra!

02:41.077 --> 02:44.577
Your chakra-stealing ninjutsu
has now been nullified!

02:45.077 --> 02:46.237
In other words, you can't move

02:46.617 --> 02:49.367
nor will you be able to extract chakra
with your next ninjutsu!

02:50.947 --> 02:53.157
<i>Good timing, son of the Fourth!</i>

02:53.577 --> 02:56.947
<i>Let's get him with this</i>
<i>and seal him away!</i>

03:02.537 --> 03:06.617
Naruto aimed his attack over there,
so that's where Madara is!

03:07.697 --> 03:08.987
Naruto, this way!

03:10.077 --> 03:10.697
Let's go!

03:10.907 --> 03:12.287
Thanks, Sai!

03:12.947 --> 03:13.947
Don't waste any time!

03:13.947 --> 03:15.867
Now's our chance to seal him!

03:16.157 --> 03:18.617
We won't let Naruto's attack
go to waste!

03:18.787 --> 03:19.487
Right!

03:21.287 --> 03:23.987
Without any orders...
without a single word...

03:24.367 --> 03:26.657
Everyone is galvanized into action...

03:27.947 --> 03:28.487
Naruto...

03:31.537 --> 03:33.197
And I'm one of them...

03:35.037 --> 03:35.487
Shukaku...

03:36.367 --> 03:39.947
I'd like to borrow the power of
your Sand to seal Madara.

03:40.827 --> 03:43.037
You mean,
the Grand Sand Mausoleum?

03:43.287 --> 03:45.907
That's right... A giant one too.

03:48.737 --> 03:52.157
I'm not bound to a Jinchuriki anymore.

03:52.447 --> 03:56.287
What makes you think I'd listen
to you after all this time?

03:57.117 --> 04:00.157
I'm not ordering you.
I'm asking you.

04:00.907 --> 04:02.077
If you refuse, fine.

04:02.407 --> 04:04.907
I'll just ask one of the others.

04:08.407 --> 04:10.487
Naruto Uzumaki, huh?

04:10.987 --> 04:16.617
Seems you've become friends
with that Fox Demon's brat, Gaara...

04:17.037 --> 04:19.947
If you're not going to help,
let's talk later.

04:20.117 --> 04:21.077
I'm going.

04:22.657 --> 04:25.947
That tone you're using ticks me off!

04:26.827 --> 04:29.447
As they say, if a fox has
seven tricks, a tanuki has eight!

04:30.077 --> 04:33.407
And I, the Demon Tanuki,
will not lose to a stupid fox!

04:35.037 --> 04:37.827
I'm not doing this
because you asked!

04:37.907 --> 04:40.827
I'm doing this because I want to!

04:42.077 --> 04:43.287
Lead the way.

04:44.737 --> 04:45.537
It's this way.

04:46.237 --> 04:47.157
Now then...

04:47.367 --> 04:48.327
Wait up.

04:48.657 --> 04:49.197
Huh?

04:52.077 --> 04:54.077
We'll help too.

04:56.657 --> 04:59.657
<i>That's why I want</i>
<i>to help you too...</i>

05:00.697 --> 05:04.367
Don't worry.
We're not doing this on a whim.

05:05.077 --> 05:07.037
We want to help Naruto.

05:10.827 --> 05:11.827
I'm grateful.

05:12.287 --> 05:17.037
Sand Shinobi human,
are you a friend of Naruto too?

05:20.987 --> 05:22.157
It's a monster!

05:22.697 --> 05:23.787
Stay away!

05:24.657 --> 05:26.287
Use the buildings as a shield!

05:26.487 --> 05:28.237
But do not go inside!

05:28.537 --> 05:30.447
If they collapse,
you'll be buried alive!

05:52.737 --> 05:53.617
Are you all right?

05:55.237 --> 05:56.037
Yeah...

06:01.327 --> 06:03.157
That's my kid brother?

06:04.367 --> 06:06.077
H-He's just a—!

06:25.407 --> 06:26.367
Hello!

06:30.987 --> 06:31.907
Hello!

06:37.117 --> 06:38.577
Hello...

06:54.037 --> 06:54.907
Run!

06:58.117 --> 06:59.407
W-Wait...!

07:00.327 --> 07:01.487
Help!

07:01.867 --> 07:03.327
Don't leave me by myself!

07:06.907 --> 07:09.947
I hate it... I hate it!

07:11.077 --> 07:14.367
<i>People hurt others and</i>
<i>others hurt them...</i>

07:14.577 --> 07:16.577
<i>That's how they learn to survive.</i>

07:17.367 --> 07:22.077
<i>But it's not that easy for</i>
<i>one person to hate another...</i>

07:34.077 --> 07:35.697
It's not bleeding, but...

07:36.947 --> 07:40.117
it really hurts right around here.

07:41.907 --> 07:43.657
That is a wound of the heart.

07:44.487 --> 07:48.327
It's a troublesome wound that
only the love from another can cure.

07:49.037 --> 07:50.367
Love?

07:51.577 --> 07:52.987
Love is a feeling

07:53.077 --> 07:56.617
that desires to serve a precious person
who is close to oneself,

07:56.697 --> 07:58.867
to love and watch over
that person...

08:00.987 --> 08:01.907
Die!

08:03.367 --> 08:05.407
Don't get involved with him.

08:07.237 --> 08:08.117
Stupid!

08:08.487 --> 08:09.537
Don't look.

08:09.947 --> 08:10.827
Get lost!

08:12.827 --> 08:14.447
Your name is Gaara...

08:15.947 --> 08:17.827
A demon that loves only itself.

08:18.037 --> 08:23.697
One that loves only itself
and fights only for itself.

08:25.197 --> 08:28.907
Because you were never loved.

08:51.197 --> 08:53.737
He's just a monster!

09:23.197 --> 09:25.577
D-Don't you feel anything?

09:26.327 --> 09:27.157
Kankuro...

09:28.037 --> 09:29.037
They were our friends!

09:33.867 --> 09:37.037
You killed... friends from our village...

09:37.117 --> 09:38.407
Don't you feel anything...

09:39.037 --> 09:39.907
right here?!

09:40.447 --> 09:42.037
Doesn't your heart hurt?!

09:43.487 --> 09:45.787
If you don't shut up, I'll kill you.

09:50.157 --> 09:52.787
<i>I was a killing machine</i>
<i>from the time I was born...</i>

09:53.117 --> 09:54.907
<i>An uncontrollable monster...</i>

09:55.947 --> 09:58.237
<i>My mother died giving birth to me...</i>

09:58.617 --> 10:02.117
<i>The village ignored me...</i>
<i>my siblings avoided me...</i>

10:02.907 --> 10:06.237
<i>I was made a target for</i>
<i>assassination by my father...</i>

10:08.237 --> 10:09.907
<i>I was alone...</i>

10:09.947 --> 10:12.447
<i>And a solitary weapon</i>
<i>didn't need a heart.</i>

10:14.737 --> 10:18.077
<i>Then I was sent as a weapon</i>
<i>to destroy Hidden Leaf Village...</i>

10:19.407 --> 10:21.077
<i>where I met him.</i>

10:37.937 --> 10:38.727
Let's go.

10:41.477 --> 10:43.227
Hey, you there...

10:44.517 --> 10:45.887
What's your name?

10:48.387 --> 10:50.267
Gaara of the Sand.

10:50.977 --> 10:52.977
I'm curious about you too.

10:53.347 --> 10:54.347
What's your name?

10:56.687 --> 10:58.307
Sasuke Uchiha.

11:01.637 --> 11:04.637
Hey! Hey! And what about me?

11:05.267 --> 11:06.387
I'm not interested.

11:07.267 --> 11:09.017
<i>Naruto Uzumaki...</i>

11:09.477 --> 11:13.847
<i>My first encounter</i>
<i>with him was uninteresting.</i>

11:15.727 --> 11:16.517
<i>However...</i>

11:17.727 --> 11:19.977
I'm definitely going to win!

11:20.637 --> 11:22.807
<i>But with every little incident,</i>

11:22.887 --> 11:25.477
<i>his words and actions</i>
<i>towards his friends</i>

11:25.557 --> 11:29.057
<i>began to send ripples</i>
<i>through my heart.</i>

11:33.437 --> 11:34.387
Why you!

11:34.477 --> 11:36.307
What were you trying to do
to Bushy Brows!

11:37.557 --> 11:39.057
I was trying to kill him.

11:40.387 --> 11:43.267
If you get in my way,
I'll kill you too.

11:43.847 --> 11:46.057
As if someone like you
can kill me!

11:46.137 --> 11:48.267
I keep telling you to cut it out!

11:48.887 --> 11:51.267
This guy has monster-like strength.

11:51.637 --> 11:54.597
I have a real monster inside me.

11:54.687 --> 11:56.267
I wouldn't lose to a guy like him!

11:58.227 --> 12:02.137
<i>Furthermore, he started to</i>
<i>have an effect on me...</i>

12:02.477 --> 12:07.097
<i>He wasn't like the others</i>
<i>who merely aroused hatred in me.</i>

12:08.057 --> 12:11.187
Just what are they to you?

12:12.097 --> 12:13.977
He's my friend!

12:15.137 --> 12:19.977
If you even attempt to hurt him,
I'll pummel you!

12:20.057 --> 12:21.137
A friend?!

12:21.187 --> 12:22.727
Don't make me laugh...

12:22.807 --> 12:25.517
I only fight...

12:30.057 --> 12:31.187
for myself!

12:32.097 --> 12:34.057
Because he resembles me...

12:34.227 --> 12:36.187
Because he has gone through life

12:36.267 --> 12:39.187
with the same loneliness
and sadness as I have...

12:39.387 --> 12:43.227
That guy who continued to fight
in solitude for himself,

12:43.307 --> 12:45.267
I thought he was strong.

12:50.267 --> 12:55.137
But that's not the meaning
of true strength...

12:56.187 --> 12:58.977
If one fights just for oneself
in solitude,

12:59.057 --> 13:02.017
one can't become truly strong...

13:06.187 --> 13:08.137
Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu!

13:09.057 --> 13:16.937
Na-Ru-To! 2K Uzumaki...

13:17.017 --> 13:18.437
Barrage!

13:20.977 --> 13:22.477
<i>There's no way...</i>

13:23.097 --> 13:30.097
<i>I can lose...</i>
<i>to a guy like him!</i>

13:33.387 --> 13:39.387
<i>The more I drove him into a corner,</i>
<i>the harder he fought back...</i>

13:39.517 --> 13:41.187
Summoning Jutsu!

13:47.307 --> 13:49.057
Transformation Jutsu!

13:52.597 --> 13:54.937
Get up, you jerk!

14:00.807 --> 14:03.057
<i>Time and time again...</i>

14:04.137 --> 14:05.847
<i>after hitting rock bottom...</i>

14:10.057 --> 14:11.267
Die!

14:11.347 --> 14:13.347
You bastard!

14:26.767 --> 14:28.097
<i>Why...?</i>

14:28.347 --> 14:30.977
<i>What kind of strength</i>
<i>does he possess?</i>

14:32.017 --> 14:33.097
Why?

14:34.017 --> 14:38.097
Why do you go so far for others?

14:42.057 --> 14:46.307
Because they are my precious friends
who saved me from that hell,

14:46.387 --> 14:52.387
of being alone, and who acknowledged
my existence.

14:59.097 --> 15:00.687
Love...

15:01.227 --> 15:03.807
Is that why he is so strong?

15:05.847 --> 15:09.227
<i>This day would come to</i>
<i>hold special meaning for me...</i>

15:09.977 --> 15:12.637
<i>I learned that he grew up</i>
<i>under the same circumstances as me,</i>

15:12.727 --> 15:15.637
<i>yet he chose</i>
<i>a different way to live...</i>

15:16.097 --> 15:21.137
<i>And that my strength was</i>
<i>directly connected to this.</i>

15:23.227 --> 15:27.307
I just have to work hard and
carve out a future for myself.

15:28.057 --> 15:30.557
And I must not run away
from my path of solitude.

15:31.597 --> 15:33.057
If I do that, someday...

15:33.137 --> 15:35.307
I can be like him.

15:37.097 --> 15:39.687
So as a shinobi
who belongs to the Sand,

15:39.767 --> 15:41.767
I will aim to become the Kazekage.

15:42.097 --> 15:44.887
In order to connect with
this village and live in it.

15:45.597 --> 15:46.687
Gaara...

15:48.347 --> 15:50.977
Watching Naruto Uzumaki
makes me feel this way.

15:51.767 --> 15:53.477
A connection with others...

15:53.847 --> 15:58.187
Until now, that only meant hatred
and a desire to kill.

15:59.097 --> 16:04.057
So just what is this connection
that he keeps talking about?

16:04.727 --> 16:08.057
After all this time, I understand
a little bit about something...

16:11.227 --> 16:14.227
Suffering and sadness...
even happiness...

16:15.097 --> 16:18.687
can be shared with someone.

16:19.847 --> 16:21.477
Naruto Uzumaki...

16:22.187 --> 16:24.887
He has known
the same suffering I have...

16:24.977 --> 16:26.807
And he has taught me

16:26.887 --> 16:29.557
that it is possible to
change one's path in life...

16:30.347 --> 16:34.767
I, too, want to become the kind of man
that everyone looks up to...

16:35.807 --> 16:38.097
Instead of just being
a weapon to be fearful of.

16:39.227 --> 16:41.597
As the Kazekage of the Hidden Sand.

16:43.597 --> 16:49.267
<i>I was able to take a step forward,</i>
<i>away from my pessimistic life.</i>

16:50.517 --> 16:53.017
<i>And I became the Kazekage.</i>

16:53.187 --> 16:54.937
<i>I have gained more friends,</i>

16:55.017 --> 16:58.187
<i>and I continue to strive to be</i>
<i>someone who is needed by others.</i>

16:58.597 --> 17:03.017
<i>And with my head held high,</i>
<i>I stood as his equal,</i>

17:03.097 --> 17:05.137
<i>and step by step,</i>

17:05.227 --> 17:09.017
<i>I aimed for the day when</i>
<i>I could be acknowledged as his friend.</i>

17:10.227 --> 17:11.267
<i>However...</i>

17:26.687 --> 17:29.097
<i>Whose... hand is this?</i>

17:31.387 --> 17:34.057
<i>Oh... it's my hand.</i>

17:38.347 --> 17:44.017
<i>Have I become someone</i>
<i>who is needed by somebody?</i>

17:45.097 --> 17:46.137
<i>Huh?</i>

17:46.687 --> 17:48.017
<i>What is this?</i>

17:50.227 --> 17:51.137
<i>It's me?</i>

17:57.267 --> 17:58.807
<i>That's me...</i>

17:59.057 --> 18:02.807
<i>I really wanted to be needed...</i>

18:04.267 --> 18:08.307
<i>Why? Why did I desire that?</i>

18:09.097 --> 18:13.227
<i>Why am I someone</i>
<i>who desires that?</i>

18:14.227 --> 18:18.137
<i>Those eyes...</i>
<i>that nose, that mouth...</i>

18:21.057 --> 18:22.097
<i>Why?</i>

18:23.847 --> 18:26.267
<i>Why is that Gaara?</i>

18:28.267 --> 18:30.137
<i>I was inside that...</i>

18:30.847 --> 18:34.057
<i>No... Actually just what am I?</i>

18:36.137 --> 18:38.137
<i>That's what I feel I am...</i>

18:39.057 --> 18:43.057
<i>But actually... what am I?</i>

18:44.307 --> 18:48.187
<i>Just a small feeling?</i>

18:49.727 --> 18:51.977
Gaara... Gaara!

18:52.437 --> 18:53.347
<i>Who is that?</i>

18:53.557 --> 18:55.267
<i>Who are you calling?</i>

18:58.347 --> 18:59.387
<i>Who is it?</i>

18:59.977 --> 19:01.227
<i>Who's hand is this?</i>

19:03.767 --> 19:06.437
<i>Oh... It's just my hand again...</i>

19:09.557 --> 19:11.137
<i>My hand...</i>

19:13.887 --> 19:14.847
<i>Me?</i>

19:16.137 --> 19:18.097
<i>Who am I?</i>

19:19.137 --> 19:20.097
<i>I...</i>

19:25.267 --> 19:27.017
<i>I am...</i>

19:35.517 --> 19:39.437
<i>When the Akatsuki extracted</i>
<i>the Tailed Beast from me...</i>

19:39.807 --> 19:43.687
<i>I died, but was revived...</i>

19:44.227 --> 19:45.727
<i>thanks to Granny Chiyo</i>

19:45.807 --> 19:48.187
<i>who used a Forbidden Jutsu</i>
<i>to exchange her life for mine,</i>

19:48.267 --> 19:50.887
<i>and Naruto's chakra.</i>

19:52.017 --> 19:52.727
So long.

19:53.597 --> 19:54.557
Right!

20:01.727 --> 20:05.017
Normally, people shake hands
when they part.

20:05.387 --> 20:07.687
But I'm not so good with
stuff like that...

20:08.057 --> 20:08.887
So...

20:11.387 --> 20:13.517
<i>I thought I've been doing my best</i>

20:13.597 --> 20:17.137
<i>in order to be accepted</i>
<i>by you as a friend.</i>

20:18.267 --> 20:21.097
<i>I thought I had to become someone</i>
<i>who was essential to others...</i>

20:21.187 --> 20:24.517
<i>someone people looked up to...</i>

20:25.267 --> 20:26.137
<i>But...</i>

20:32.807 --> 20:34.767
<i>But on that day, we...</i>

20:34.847 --> 20:38.347
<i>came to understand,</i>
<i>and accept each other...</i>

20:38.437 --> 20:41.017
<i>We were already friends.</i>

20:43.097 --> 20:44.057
What's wrong?

20:44.517 --> 20:47.097
I asked if you are Naruto's friend?

20:47.937 --> 20:48.807
Yeah...

20:49.137 --> 20:50.767
He's my first friend.

20:53.097 --> 20:54.267
Is that right?

20:57.557 --> 20:59.227
All right, let's hurry.

